<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">hide&nbsp;comments</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Not a greenlighter, just wanted to express my interest in the idea :) The premise is immediately engaging to me as a &quot;real-life&quot; story that has taken on a power of its own, and the reiterative nature of SCP offers up many interesting interpretations before the SCP is contained. That said, as others have mentioned, I wonder what the Foundation would do with this object once it was contained, or how they would interact with it prior to containment. Nothing wrong with a &quot;Safe&quot; SCP, but the story might be better told as a tale than as a relatively boring article that happens to mention the much more interesting history of the object.</p>
<p>In any case, can't wait to see the finished product!</p>
</div>
